msgid "Unknown operation."
msgstr "未知操作。"

msgid ""
"Invalid account name: lowercase letters, digits, '.', '_' and '-', starting "
"with a letter or digit, at most 64 characters; svc- only as svc-docker-"
"<node>."
msgstr "账号名无效：只能包含小写字母、数字、'.'、'_' 和 '-'，以字母或数字开头，最多 64 个字符；svc- 只能用于 svc-docker-<node>。"

#, python-format
msgid "%(name)s is changed with proxy_accounts.py on the VM only."
msgstr "%(name)s 只能在虚拟机上用 proxy_accounts.py 修改。"

msgid "The accounts status is unavailable, so no change can be requested."
msgstr "账号状态不可用，暂时无法提交变更。"

#, python-format
msgid "The account %(name)s exists."
msgstr "账号 %(name)s 已存在。"

#, python-format
msgid "There is no account %(name)s."
msgstr "没有账号 %(name)s。"

msgid "A service account cannot be an admin account."
msgstr "服务账号不能成为管理员账号。"

msgid "the HA entries (xray-ha) and every proxy"
msgstr "HA 入口 (xray-ha) 和所有代理"

msgid "the HA entries (xray-ha) and the private proxies"
msgstr "HA 入口 (xray-ha) 和私有代理"

msgid "the HA entries (xray-ha)"
msgstr "HA 入口 (xray-ha)"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Applying restarts %(services)s. Established connections through them drop, "
"and new ones fail for a few seconds."
msgstr "应用时会重启%(services)s。经过它们的已建立连接会断开，新连接会有几秒失败。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Creates the proxy account %(name)s with a new random password, which you see "
"once when the change is live. It may use ha-general and the public proxies."
msgstr "创建代理账号 %(name)s 并生成随机密码，变更生效后你可以查看一次密码。该账号可以使用 ha-general 和公共代理。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Gives %(name)s a new random password, which you see once when it is live. "
"The old password stops working."
msgstr "为 %(name)s 生成新的随机密码，生效后你可以查看一次。旧密码随即失效。"

#, python-format
msgid "Turns proxy access on for %(name)s, with its current password."
msgstr "为 %(name)s 开启代理访问，密码不变。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Turns proxy access off for %(name)s. The account and its password are kept: "
"turning it on again restores it."
msgstr "关闭 %(name)s 的代理访问。账号和密码会保留：重新开启即可恢复。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Removes the account %(name)s and its password. Adding it again gives it a "
"new password."
msgstr "删除账号 %(name)s 及其密码。重新添加会得到新密码。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Makes %(name)s an admin account: it may also use ha-private and the private "
"proxies. This is the proxy account's flag, not the Determined admin role."
msgstr "将 %(name)s 设为管理员账号：还可以使用 ha-private 和私有代理。这是代理账号的标记，不是 Determined 管理员角色。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(name)s stops being an admin account: ha-private and the private proxies "
"refuse it."
msgstr "%(name)s 不再是管理员账号：ha-private 和私有代理会拒绝它。"

msgid ""
"Raw auth is on: every entry, the public proxies' own entries included, "
"refuses an account whose proxy access is off."
msgstr "公共代理入口认证 (raw auth) 已开启：所有入口（包括公共代理自己的入口）都会拒绝已关闭代理访问的账号。"

msgid ""
"Raw auth is off: proxy access off stops only ha-general, ha-private and the "
"private proxies. A public proxy's own entry needs no account, so it still "
"works for that user."
msgstr "公共代理入口认证 (raw auth) 已关闭：关闭代理访问只会让 ha-general、ha-private 和私有代理拒绝该账号。公共代理自己的入口不需要账号，该用户仍可使用。"

msgid ""
"The request could not be written to the applier's spool. Nothing changed."
msgstr "无法把请求写入执行器 (applier) 的队列目录。没有任何变更。"

msgid "Type the account name to confirm."
msgstr "请输入账号名确认。"

msgid "Status unknown: no recent probe results for the default proxy"
msgstr "状态未知：默认代理近期没有探测结果"

msgid "Default proxy available"
msgstr "默认代理可用"

#, python-format
msgid "Default proxy available; its %(n)d pool proxy is passing"
msgid_plural "Default proxy available; all %(n)d pool proxies passing"
msgstr[0] "默认代理可用；代理池中 %(n)d 个代理全部正常"

msgid "Default proxy answering, but no pool proxy passes its probe"
msgstr "默认代理有响应，但代理池中没有代理通过探测"

msgid "Default proxy available on its last passing pool proxy, without a spare"
msgstr "默认代理仅剩一个正常的池内代理，没有备用"

#, python-format
msgid "Default proxy available; %(n)d pool proxy not passing, failover working"
msgid_plural ""
"Default proxy available; %(n)d pool proxies not passing, failover working"
msgstr[0] "默认代理可用；代理池中 %(n)d 个代理未通过探测，故障切换正常"

msgid ""
"Default proxy failing while its pool proxies pass: the HA entry itself is "
"down"
msgstr "默认代理故障，但代理池中的代理正常：高可用入口本身不可用"

msgid "Default proxy failing: no pool proxy passes its probe"
msgstr "默认代理故障：代理池中没有代理通过探测"

msgid "Default proxy failing"
msgstr "默认代理故障"

msgid "HTTP entry failing, SOCKS5 still available"
msgstr "HTTP 入口故障，SOCKS5 仍可用"

msgid "SOCKS5 entry failing, HTTP still available"
msgstr "SOCKS5 入口故障，HTTP 仍可用"

msgid "HTTP entry available; SOCKS5 status unknown"
msgstr "HTTP 入口可用；SOCKS5 状态未知"

msgid "SOCKS5 entry available; HTTP status unknown"
msgstr "SOCKS5 入口可用；HTTP 状态未知"

msgid "HTTP entry failing; SOCKS5 status unknown"
msgstr "HTTP 入口故障；SOCKS5 状态未知"

msgid "SOCKS5 entry failing; HTTP status unknown"
msgstr "SOCKS5 入口故障；HTTP 状态未知"

msgid "Waiting for the applier. Not applied yet: the old access still works."
msgstr "等待执行器处理。尚未应用：原有访问仍然有效。"

msgid "Waiting for the applier. Not applied yet."
msgstr "等待执行器处理。尚未应用。"

#, python-format
msgid "Not taken after %(n)d minutes: the applier may not be running."
msgstr "已 %(n)d 分钟未被处理：执行器可能没有运行。"

msgid ""
"Being applied; the affected entries restart. A revoke not yet confirmed: the "
"old access may still work."
msgstr "正在应用，受影响的入口会重启。撤销尚未确认：原有访问可能仍然有效。"

msgid "Being applied; the affected entries restart."
msgstr "正在应用，受影响的入口会重启。"

msgid ""
"Nothing to change: the account was already in that state. Nothing restarted."
msgstr "无需变更：账号已处于该状态。没有重启任何服务。"

msgid "Applied and verified."
msgstr "已应用并验证。"

msgid ""
"Live: the entries refuse the old access (verified), but no proxy answered "
"the checks that must pass in time, so the entries may not be passing traffic "
"right now."
msgstr "已生效：入口已拒绝原有访问（已验证），但应当通过的检查在超时内没有代理响应，入口目前可能无法转发流量。"

msgid ""
"Live: the old password is refused (verified). The new password is not "
"confirmed yet: no proxy answered in time."
msgstr "已生效：旧密码已被拒绝（已验证）。新密码尚未确认：超时内没有代理响应。"

msgid ""
"Live, but not confirmed yet: no proxy answered the new login in time (the "
"proxies or the check target may be down)."
msgstr "已生效，但尚未确认：超时内没有代理响应新的登录（代理或检查目标可能不可用）。"

msgid "Refused by the applier. Nothing changed."
msgstr "执行器拒绝了该请求。没有任何变更。"

msgid ""
"Failed, and the rollback did not finish: the entries may be down or in a "
"mixed state. Check the applier on the VM (journalctl -u proxy-apply)."
msgstr "失败，且回滚未完成：入口可能不可用或处于混合状态。请在虚拟机上检查执行器 (journalctl -u proxy-apply)。"

msgid ""
"Failed; the previous state is back. Nothing changed: the old access still "
"works."
msgstr "失败，已恢复到之前的状态。没有任何变更：原有访问仍然有效。"

msgid "Failed; the previous state is back. Nothing changed."
msgstr "失败，已恢复到之前的状态。没有任何变更。"

msgid "The new password is handed out once the change is live."
msgstr "变更生效后才会提供新密码。"

msgid ""
"The new password is ready. It is shown once, to you only, and then deleted."
msgstr "新密码已就绪。它只显示一次，仅对你可见，随后即被删除。"

#, python-format
msgid "Only %(admin)s, who made this request, can see the new password."
msgstr "只有提交该请求的 %(admin)s 可以查看新密码。"

msgid ""
"The password was shown once and is not kept anywhere. For a new one, request "
"a new password."
msgstr "该密码已显示过一次，任何地方都不会保存。如需新密码，请再申请一次新密码。"

msgid ""
"The one-time password expired: results are deleted after 10 minutes. For a "
"new one, request a new password."
msgstr "一次性密码已过期：结果会在 10 分钟后删除。如需新密码，请再申请一次新密码。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"A later request replaced this password: use the password of request %(id)s."
msgstr "之后的请求替换了这个密码：请使用请求 %(id)s 的密码。"

msgid ""
"No password was handed out for this request. For a new one, request a new "
"password."
msgstr "这个请求没有提供密码。如需新密码，请再申请一次新密码。"

msgid ""
"The one-time result could not be read and was deleted. For a new one, "
"request a new password."
msgstr "无法读取一次性结果，已将其删除。如需新密码，请再申请一次新密码。"

msgid "No password: the change was not applied."
msgstr "没有密码：变更未应用。"

