msgid "My access"
msgstr "我的接入"

msgid "My proxy access"
msgstr "我的代理接入"

msgid ""
"Your proxy account, named after your Determined username, as the proxy "
"accounts file records it, and the entries it may use. Requests still waiting "
"are not shown. Passwords are never shown here."
msgstr ""
"你的代理账号（以你的 Determined 用户名命名）在代理账号文件中的记录，以及它可"
"以使用的入口。尚在等待中的请求不在此显示。这里从不显示密码。"

msgid ""
"Account information is unavailable right now. Try again later; the proxies "
"themselves are not affected."
msgstr "账号信息暂时不可用，请稍后再试；代理本身不受影响。"

msgid ""
"This account information has not been refreshed for a while and may be out "
"of date."
msgstr "账号信息已有一段时间没有更新，可能不是最新状态。"

msgid "Account"
msgstr "账号"

#, python-format
msgid "%(name)s has no proxy account."
msgstr "%(name)s 没有代理账号。"

msgid ""
"To get one, ask an admin: the account is named after your Determined "
"username, and the admin gives you its password."
msgstr ""
"如需账号，请联系管理员：账号以你的 Determined 用户名命名，由管理员告诉你密"
"码。"

msgid ""
"Without an account you can use the public proxies' own entries: they accept "
"anyone while raw auth is off."
msgstr ""
"没有账号时可以使用公共代理自己的入口：在公共代理入口认证 (raw auth) 关闭时，"
"它们接受任何人。"

#, python-format
msgid "Proxy access is <b>on</b> for the account <b>%(name)s</b>."
msgstr "账号 <b>%(name)s</b> 的代理访问已<b>开启</b>。"

msgid ""
"This is an admin account: it may also use ha-private and the private proxies."
msgstr "这是管理员账号：还可以使用 ha-private 和私有代理。"

#, python-format
msgid "Proxy access is <b>off</b> for the account <b>%(name)s</b>."
msgstr "账号 <b>%(name)s</b> 的代理访问已<b>关闭</b>。"

msgid "Every entry refuses it, the public proxies' own entries included."
msgstr "所有入口都拒绝它，包括公共代理自己的入口。"

msgid ""
"ha-general, ha-private and the private proxies refuse it. The public "
"proxies' own entries still work for you: they need no account while raw auth "
"(accounts on the public proxies' own entries) is off."
msgstr ""
"ha-general、ha-private 和私有代理拒绝它。公共代理自己的入口仍可使用：公共代理"
"入口认证 (raw auth) 关闭时无需账号。"

msgid ""
"ha-general refuses it. The public proxies' own entries still work for you: "
"they need no account while raw auth (accounts on the public proxies' own "
"entries) is off."
msgstr ""
"ha-general 拒绝它。公共代理自己的入口仍可使用：公共代理入口认证 (raw auth) 关"
"闭时无需账号。"

msgid ""
"Raw auth (accounts on the public proxies' own entries) is off: a public "
"proxy's own entry accepts anyone, without an account, so turning an account "
"off stops only the HA entries and the private proxies for it."
msgstr ""
"公共代理入口认证 (raw auth) 已关闭：公共代理自己的入口无需账号、接受任何人，"
"所以关闭一个账号的代理访问只会让高可用入口和私有代理拒绝它。"

msgid ""
"Raw auth (accounts on the public proxies' own entries) is on: every entry "
"requires an enabled account."
msgstr "公共代理入口认证 (raw auth) 已开启：所有入口都需要已启用的账号。"

msgid ""
"Proxy access off is not a change to your cluster account: your Determined "
"login, jobs and files are not affected."
msgstr ""
"关闭代理访问不会改变你的集群账号：你的 Determined 登录、任务和文件都不受影"
"响。"

msgid ""
"The proxy admin flag is set per proxy account by the admins; it is not the "
"Determined admin role."
msgstr "代理管理员标记由管理员按代理账号设置，与 Determined 的管理员角色无关。"

msgid "Need an account or a new password? Ask an admin."
msgstr "需要账号或新密码？请联系管理员。"

msgid "Entries"
msgstr "入口"

msgid ""
"Every account may use ha-general and the public proxies; admin accounts also "
"ha-private and the private proxies. Same ports on both networks: the private "
"network from the nodes, the campus network from the login node."
msgstr ""
"每个账号都可以使用 ha-general 和公共代理；管理员账号还可以使用 ha-private 和"
"私有代理。两个网络的端口相同：节点上用内网地址，登录节点上用校园网地址。"

msgid "Default proxy"
msgstr "默认代理"

msgid "Private entry"
msgstr "私有入口"

msgid "Private"
msgstr "私有"

msgid "No account needed"
msgstr "无需账号"

msgid "Usable"
msgstr "可用"

msgid "Needs an account"
msgstr "需要账号"

msgid "Proxy access off"
msgstr "代理访问已关闭"

msgid "HA over the public proxies, with your account."
msgstr "在公共代理之间高可用切换，使用你的账号。"

msgid "HA over every proxy, with your admin account."
msgstr "在所有代理之间高可用切换，使用你的管理员账号。"

msgid "One proxy, no failover, with your account."
msgstr "单个代理，不切换，使用你的账号。"

msgid "One proxy, no failover, without an account."
msgstr "单个代理，不切换，无需账号。"

msgid "Private network"
msgstr "内网"

msgid "Campus network"
msgstr "校园网"

msgid "Ports not published"
msgstr "端口未发布"

msgid "No entries"
msgstr "没有入口"

msgid "Client settings"
msgstr "客户端设置"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"For the default proxy ha-general. Replace %(placeholder)s with your "
"account's password; socks5h lets the proxy resolve names."
msgstr ""
"适用于默认代理 ha-general。把 %(placeholder)s 换成你账号的密码；socks5h 表示"
"由代理解析域名。"

msgid "Network"
msgstr "网络"

msgid ""
"Keep the password to yourself: set it in your own shell profile or task "
"environment, never in images, notebooks, shared task templates or "
"repositories. If it leaks, ask an admin for a new one."
msgstr ""
"请自行保管密码：只写在自己的 shell 配置或任务环境中，不要写进镜像、notebook、"
"共享的任务模板或代码仓库。如有泄露，请联系管理员更换。"

msgid "Private network (the nodes)"
msgstr "内网（节点）"

msgid "Campus network (the login node)"
msgstr "校园网（登录节点）"

msgid "Environment variables"
msgstr "环境变量"

msgid "curl over HTTP"
msgstr "curl，HTTP"

msgid "curl over SOCKS5 (socks5h)"
msgstr "curl，SOCKS5 (socks5h)"

msgid "git, for GitHub over HTTPS"
msgstr "git，经 HTTPS 访问 GitHub"

msgid "Copied"
msgstr "已复制"

msgid "Copy"
msgstr "复制"

msgid "Client settings appear here once you have a proxy account."
msgstr "有代理账号后，这里会显示客户端设置。"

msgid "Client settings appear here while proxy access is on."
msgstr "代理访问开启时，这里会显示客户端设置。"

msgid "Title"
msgstr "标题"

msgid "Affected component"
msgstr "受影响的组件"

msgid "State"
msgstr "状态"

msgid "Started"
msgstr "开始时间"

msgid "Empty: now."
msgstr "留空：当前时间。"

msgid "Text"
msgstr "内容"

msgid "Shown on the public status page as plain text."
msgstr "以纯文本显示在公开的状态页面上。"

msgid "Admin"
msgstr "管理"

msgid "Accounts"
msgstr "账号"

msgid "Change log"
msgstr "变更记录"

msgid "Incidents"
msgstr "事件"

msgid "Requests"
msgstr "请求"

msgid "Requested"
msgstr "提交时间"

msgid "By"
msgstr "提交人"

msgid "Operation"
msgstr "操作"

msgid "Stage"
msgstr "阶段"

msgid "Details"
msgstr "详情"

msgid "Not restored"
msgstr "未恢复"

msgid "No requests"
msgstr "没有请求"

msgid "Proxy accounts"
msgstr "代理账号"

msgid ""
"The accounts as the applier last read the accounts file. Each change is a "
"request that the applier on the VM applies and verifies; this list changes "
"once it has."
msgstr "执行器最近一次读取账号文件时的账号列表。每项变更都是一个请求，由虚拟机上的执行器应用并验证；完成后此列表才会变化。"

msgid ""
"The accounts status has not been refreshed for a while: the applier may not "
"be running."
msgstr "账号状态已有一段时间没有更新：执行器可能没有运行。"

msgid ""
"The accounts file holds a change made with proxy_accounts.py that the "
"applier has not applied: it may not be running yet."
msgstr "账号文件中有用 proxy_accounts.py 做的、执行器尚未应用的变更：它可能还没有生效。"

msgid ""
"Every change restarts the affected entries: established connections through "
"them drop."
msgstr "每项变更都会重启受影响的入口：经过它们的已建立连接会断开。"

#, python-format
msgid "%(n)s account"
msgid_plural "%(n)s accounts"
msgstr[0] "%(n)s 个账号"

#, python-format
msgid "matching “%(q)s”"
msgstr "匹配“%(q)s”"

msgid "Search"
msgstr "搜索"

msgid "Kind"
msgstr "类型"

msgid "Proxy access"
msgstr "代理访问"

msgid "Admin account"
msgstr "管理员账号"

msgid "Pending request"
msgstr "待处理请求"

msgid "Actions"
msgstr "操作"

msgid "Service"
msgstr "服务"

msgid "User"
msgstr "用户"

msgid "On"
msgstr "开启"

msgid "Off"
msgstr "关闭"

msgid "Off at the HA entries"
msgstr "HA 入口已关闭"

msgid "Changed with proxy_accounts.py only"
msgstr "只能用 proxy_accounts.py 修改"

msgid "No account matches."
msgstr "没有匹配的账号。"

msgid "Add an account"
msgstr "添加账号"

msgid ""
"A person's account is named exactly as their Determined username; a node's "
"Docker daemon uses svc-docker-<node>."
msgstr "个人账号与其 Determined 用户名完全相同；节点的 Docker 守护进程使用 svc-docker-<node>。"

msgid "Account name"
msgstr "账号名"

msgid ""
