"Whether requests get through the HA entries and each proxy, from probes "
"every 30 seconds. The status of an entry is not whether your account may use "
"it: see My access."
msgstr ""
"根据每 30 秒一次的探测，显示请求能否通过高可用入口和各个代理。入口的状态不代"
"表你的账号可以使用它：请看“我的接入”。"

msgid "Last check"
msgstr "最近检查"

msgid "Monitoring data is unavailable, so every status is unknown."
msgstr "监控数据不可用，所有状态均为未知。"

