msgstr "默认代理的代理池"

msgid "passing / configured"
msgstr "正常 / 已配置"

#, python-format
msgid "Unknown when older than %(s)s s"
msgstr "超过 %(s)s 秒即为未知"

msgid ""
"The HA entries keep one address and choose a passing proxy for each new "
"connection."
msgstr "高可用入口地址固定，为每个新连接选择一个正常的代理。"

